lled PKT-0016, so this is probably fine, but it's worth confirming.\n- **Save cost:** the save runs used an empty change list, so they measure only the fixed cost of a save. The diagnosis says so.\n- **Noise:** results vary by up to ±30% between runs on this 2-CPU machine. The diagnosis says so, and which phase dominates doesn't change.\n\nVERDICT: APPROVE all goal measurements recorded with raw runs and phase analysis; baseline.md copy correctly handed to a spawn request because that file is outside the target","ttft_ms":2262,"type":"result","duration_ms":17507,"uuid":"67cb0f5d-df8f-48d3-b8a3-4b90b938ad57","ttft_stream_ms":1004,"time_to_request_ms":367,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":8,"system_prompt":183,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":5,"input_attachments":29,"input_hooks":3,"conversation_append":1,"transcript_persist":19,"tool_pool_refresh":0,"init_message":9,"init_frame_send":4,"engine_pickup":1,"loop_entry":5,"message_prep":0,"model_config_wait":1,"autocompact":3,"request_announcements":17,"query_setup":8,"auto_mode_context_wait":9,"model_gates":1,"tool_schema_build":37,"message_normalization":4,"client_creation":7,"request_build":13},"turn_start_resume_kind":"none","process_turn_index":0,"time_to_request_loop_lag_ms":78,"time_to_request_cpu_ms":206,"time_to_request_major_faults":1,"process_rss_mib_turn_start":216,"process_anon_mib_turn_start":141,"process_rss_mib_result":227,"process_anon_mib_result":138,"process_peak_rss_mib":254,"process_cpu_ms_turn":1067,"process_wall_ms_turn":17507,"process_cpu_ms_streaming":436,"process_wall_ms_streaming":14179,"main_stream_count":5,"main_stream_event_count":272,"main_stream_chunk_count":82,"input_attachments_detail":{"slowest_producer":"artifact_opening_prefetch","slowest_producer_ms":13,"cpu_ms":27,"major_faults":0,"setup_ms":0,"prompt_producers_ms":0,"ambient_start_ms":12,"ambient_wait_ms":12,"render_ms":2,"producers":41,"token_counts":0},"first_content_frame_ms":1005,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":1806800